984锛�1閽伙級鍒濊悿锛�100鑺憋紝10閽伙紝10绁�锛夊�忓ソ锛�88鑺憋紝10閽伙紝5绁�锛夛紝涓�澶村綊鎴戞槸鎴戠殑锛�2鑺憋紝1閽伙紝1绁�锛夛紝骞茬吀鐖嗙背鑺憋紙3鑺憋紝3閽伙紝3绁�锛夛紝钀介洦濡傞煶锛�1鑺憋紝1閽伙紝1绁�锛�", "棰樺�栬瘽瀛楁暟鏈夐檺锛屽厛鎰熻阿杩欎簺浜猴紝浣犱滑浠ュ悗鏄�涓�澶寸殑浜轰簡锛屼斧澶翠細瀵逛綘浠�璐熻矗鐨勶紒", "缇ゅ彿336702529锛屼斧澶存伃杩庡嬀鎼�锛佲暛锛堚暞3鈺帮級鈺�"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "名医贵女", "content_zh": "初到异世 006，夜思涟漪的震惊只是那么一下下，转眼便恢复淡定，伸手拿过男人面前的空碗，“干一天活了，你便好好休息吧，我给你盛饭。”说着，也不等他的反应，直接转身去了厨房。厨房内，苏涟漪回想刚刚那一幕。他的脸棱角分明，鼻梁高挺，眼窝深邃，两道浓眉如剑一般向上入鬓，按理说应是美男子一枚，问题就出在他的皮肤上，这也是刚刚她初见震惊的原因。大虎的脸上长满了疮，那疮一层层的长，爬满了脸，整个脸上甚至没有半寸光整之地。红红的疮，有些还隐隐流脓，看起来恶心又恐怖。如果她没记错，这种疮搞不好是天疱疮，一种恶性皮肤病，病因主要是身体免疫力缺失，所以，这种疮难治又遗传。若是严重者，甚至有生命危险。她是脑科医生而非皮肤科，虽然在医科大学时多少接触过一些皮肤方面的病例，但并未深入研究，之所以记得天疱疮，是因为这种皮肤病太过严重。突然，涟漪顿了一下，而后轻笑着摇了摇头，她又犯职业病了，看见病症便忍不住开始分析，但，她发誓这一生不再行医。长长舒了一口气，告诉自己，再也不许去诊病。将盛好的疙瘩汤端到房间，看向大虎的眼神已经十分平常，淡淡微笑，“大虎，锅里还有一些，若是不够吃，一会我再给你盛。”男人终于忍不住惊讶，这苏涟漪，今日绝对反常！若是平时，她不可能对他和颜悦色，更从来不正眼看他的脸，甚至一再认为自己脸上几个疙瘩是被他染上，有那么一阵子，连院子都不让他进。将碗放到他面前，涟漪一指中间的青菜盘子，“吃些菜吧。”男人愣愣的点了点头，而后夹了一些沾着麻汁的菜叶入口，顿时，蔬菜的清香夹杂着麻汁的浓香入口，别有一番风味。他震惊了，本以为苏涟漪随意将水和面扔锅里出来的“猪食”，却如此美味，本以为不会炒菜而随意抓些菜叶，却不想别有风味。涟漪继续坐下来吃，她也是饿坏了，但吃饭的姿势也是十分斯文。男人一边吃着，一边暗暗观察对面之人，心中的谜团越来越大，这真的是苏涟漪？晚饭吃完了，涟漪将碗筷收拾到了厨房，用之前擦灰的抹布仔细擦干净了桌子。她收拾碗筷之时，男人就坐在一旁的椅子上，并未动，但犀利的目光却时不时扫向她。东西收拾完了，安静的室内平添了暧昧和尴尬。“大虎你先睡吧，我还有些衣服要洗。”涟漪尽量把话说得自然，心中开始有些紧张。倒不是嫌弃大虎的长相，却实在做不到和一个陌生人同床共枕，此时此刻她还没捋清头绪，一会一边洗衣服一边想办法如何回避这个问题罢。男人修长的手指，指向收拾得工整的床，“你是说，让我睡床？”而不是睡厨房？因太过诧异，今日竟反常的说了两句话之多，平日里的他惜字如金。大虎说的话，重点在“床”，因为苏涟漪本尊为了李家二公子“守身如玉”，自然不肯与大虎同床共枕，当然，即便是苏涟漪想同床，也得问问大虎同不同意。床只有一张，苏涟漪本尊睡了，他自然就睡了厨房。但同样一句话，听在涟漪耳中，重点自动前移到了“我”字上，那意思就是——难道你让我孤枕难眠？顿时，警惕心四起！姑且不说大虎的容貌，此时就算是给她床上放个绝世美男，她也不会动心同睡，虽是现代人，却比古人还保守。否则，不可能在现代三十一岁还是老处女。“对，你干一天农活想必是累了，别等我了，先睡吧。”涟漪微笑着，尽量把话说得自然，好像是夫妻间平常交谈一般，不露出半点破绽。“我还有活要干，明天……明天再陪你睡吧。”明天怎么办？明天自然还有明天的活。“……”他不是这个意思。也不等他有什么反应，涟漪便逃也似的跑了出去，开始洗衣服，打扫院子。木盆很大，很重，涟漪将水注入进去后，又倒了不少皂角粉，挑了几件这个时节能穿上的衣服，扔水中浸泡。她怀疑这些衣服就从未下水洗过，借着银白的月光，乳白色的皂角水碰见衣服，便开始有黑色渲染开来。涟漪的嘴角忍不住抽了以抽，这些水怕是可以直接当墨用罢。干脆脱了鞋子，直接跳到木盆里开始踩。白胖胖的小脚在污水中若隐若现，苏涟漪这个理科生竟突然有了诗情画意之心，猜想这是不是传说中的“出淤泥而不染”。踩着衣服，抬头欣赏着明亮月光。天空是纯净的墨蓝色，美得让人忍不住想伸手触碰，这是在现代都市见不到的景观。无论和平还是战乱、无论富有还是贫穷、无论现代还是穿越后的古代，头顶的月光却永远如初。晚风徐徐，有种东西包围着她，是伤感和寂寞。她不是情感激烈的人，上学时人们叫她书呆子，工作后人们称她工作狂，但思念家人和故乡，她也是有的，心情异常压抑沉重，却不知用什么方法去发泄。古人认为，月亮悬在世界的天上，但作为现代人的苏涟漪知道，月球和地球是分开的，相隔甚远。想必几十万年前，月亮也是如此吧。与这些天文现象相比，人的一生是多么短暂，人又是多么渺小。在这短短百年中，又要经历那么多命运坎坷、缠身疾病、生离死别，这世间最辛苦的便是人，那么为什么不给自己找些乐子，也算是苦中作乐。她死了，好在还有兄弟姐妹，能照顾父母，也算是了了她唯一的牵挂。从盆中跳出来，开始埋头干活，不再想这么多悲观的事，用身体的劳累遏止自己的胡思乱想。衣服太脏了，脏到苏涟漪无奈的笑。整整换了五盆水，用了皂角粉无数，才将衣服的本来颜色洗出来。当把衣服拧干，挂在高高的晾衣绳上，涟漪已经累得汗流浃背，腰酸腿疼。再次抬头望月，月已经向东沉去，刚刚墨蓝色的天空，渐渐有了青紫之色——竟洗了一夜的衣服。与几个时辰前的压抑不同，现在的心情竟豁然开朗，还觉得痛快无比。苏涟漪楞了下，遥遥想起儿时看过赵本山的一个小品，其中一句名言是——我觉得劳动人民才是最美滴人！想起赵本山一身“摩登”的农作物时装，再配合其浓浓的东北味儿，既十分滑稽，又能引起人的共鸣。清脆的笑声在院子中响起，悦耳如银铃，婉转如夜莺，刚刚压抑的沉闷被一扫而光，恬静的田园小院满是欢快。房间内的灯熄了，无人发现，窗前那抹高大的身影，冰冷眸子若有所思，两道剑眉深深拧起。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/mingyiguinu/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "When he first arrived in the different world 006, Ye Si was shocked for just a moment. He regained his composure in the blink of an eye and reached for the empty bowl in front of the man. \"It's been a long day of work. You can have a good rest. I'll serve you a meal.\" After saying that, without waiting for his reaction, he turned and went to the kitchen. In the kitchen, Su Lianyi thought about the scene just now. His face had sharp edges and corners, a high nose bridge, deep eye sockets, and two thick eyebrows that went up into his temples like swords. He should be considered a handsome man, but the problem was his skin, which was why she was shocked when she first saw him. Dahu's face was covered with sores. The sores grew layer by layer and covered his face. There was not even an inch of clean space on the entire face. The red sores, some of which oozed pus, looked disgusting and terrifying. If she remembered correctly, this sore might be pemphigus, a malignant skin disease. The main cause is a lack of immunity in the body. Therefore, this sore is difficult to treat and is hereditary. If it is severe, it may even be life-threatening. She is a brain doctor, not a dermatologist. Although she was exposed to some skin cases in medical school, she did not study it in depth. The reason why she remembered pemphigus was because this skin disease was too serious. Suddenly, Ripple paused for a moment, then chuckled and shook her head. She had an occupational disease again. When she saw the disease, she couldn't help but start analyzing it. However, she vowed not to practice medicine again in this life. He breathed a long sigh of relief and told himself that he would never go to see a doctor again. Bringing the pimple soup to the room, he looked at Dahu with a normal look and smiled lightly, \"Dahu, there is still some in the pot. If it's not enough, I will serve it to you later.\" The man finally couldn't help but be surprised. This Su Lianyi was absolutely abnormal today! Normally, she would never be nice to him, and she would never look him in the face. She even thought that the pimples on her face were caused by him. For a while, she wouldn't even let him enter the yard. Putting the bowl in front of him, Lianyi pointed at the vegetable plate in the middle, \"Eat some vegetables.\" The man nodded blankly, and then took some vegetable leaves dipped in sesame juice into his mouth. Suddenly, the fragrance of the vegetables was mixed with the strong fragrance of the sesame juice, which gave him a unique flavor. He was shocked. He thought that the \"pig food\" that Su Lianyi casually threw into the pot with water and noodles turned out to be so delicious. He thought that he didn't know how to cook and just grabbed some vegetable leaves, but he didn't want to have a special flavor. Ripple continued to sit down and eat. She was also very hungry, but her eating posture was also very graceful. While the man was eating, he secretly observed the person opposite him. The mystery in his heart grew bigger and bigger. Is this really Su Lianyi? After dinner was finished, Ripple put away the dishes in the kitchen and carefully wiped the table clean with the rag that had been used to wipe the dust. While she was clearing away the dishes, the man sat on a chair nearby and did not move, but his sharp eyes glanced at her from time to time. After packing up the things, the quiet room added to the ambiguity and embarrassment. \"Dahu, you should go to bed first, I still have some clothes to wash.\" Lianyi tried to speak as naturally as possible, but she began to feel nervous. It's not that she dislikes Dahu's appearance, but she really can't sleep with a stranger. At this moment, she hasn't figured it out yet. She will think of ways to avoid this problem while doing laundry. The man's slender fingers pointed at the neatly made bed, \"You mean, let me sleep on the bed?\" Instead of sleeping in the kitchen? Because he was so surprised, he unexpectedly spoke two sentences today. Normally, he cherished words like gold. What Dahu said focused on \"bed\", because Su Lianyi wanted to \"keep herself as pure as a jade\" for the second son of the Li family, so she naturally refused to sleep with Dahu. Of course, even if Su Lianyi wanted to sleep with Dahu, she had to ask Dahu if he agreed. There was only one bed, so Su Lianyi slept in the kitchen. But when hearing the same sentence in Lianyi's ears, the emphasis automatically shifted to the word \"I\", which means - are you leaving me alone to sleep alone? Suddenly, vigilance was everywhere! Putting aside Dahu's appearance, even if a peerless handsome man were placed on her bed, she would not be tempted to sleep with him. Although she is a modern person, she is more conservative than the ancients. Otherwise, it is impossible to remain an old maid at the age of thirty-one in modern times. \"Yes, you must be tired after a day of farm work. Don't wait for me. Go to bed first.\" Ripple smiled and tried to speak as naturally as possible, as if it were a normal conversation between husband and wife, without revealing any flaws. \"I still have work to do. Tomorrow... I'll sleep with you tomorrow.\" What to do tomorrow? Of course there will be work tomorrow. \"...\" That's not what he meant. Without waiting for his reaction, Lianyi ran out as if running away and started washing clothes and cleaning the yard. The wooden basin was large and heavy. After Ripple poured water into it, he poured a lot of saponin powder into it, picked out a few clothes that could be worn at this time, and threw them into the water to soak. She suspected that these clothes had never been washed. Under the silver moonlight, the milky white soapy water began to appear black when it touched the clothes. Ripple's mouth couldn't help but twitch. The water could be used directly as ink. I simply took off my shoes, jumped directly into the tub and started stepping on it. The white and fat little feet were looming in the sewage. Su Lianyi, a science student, suddenly felt poetic and picturesque, wondering if this was the legendary \"coming out of the mud but not stained\". Stepping on my clothes, I looked up and admired the bright moonlight. The sky is a pure ink blue, so beautiful that people can’t help but want to reach out and touch it. This is a landscape that cannot be seen in modern cities. Regardless of peace or war, whether rich or poor, whether modern or time-traveled ancient times, the moonlight above our heads will always remain the same. The evening breeze was blowing softly, and something surrounded her, which was sadness and loneliness. She is not a person with strong emotions. When she was in school, people called her a nerd, and after working, they called her a workaholic. However, she also missed her family and hometown. She felt extremely depressed and heavy, but she didn't know how to vent it. The ancients believed that the moon hung in the sky of the world, but as a modern person, Su Lianyi knew that the moon hung in the sky.", "translated": true, "title_en": "Chapter 6"}